  "description": "Some memories are better left in the past, especially the ones you poured your heart into writing. When screenwriter Yujin turns her bittersweet youthful romance into a drama script, she expects a quiet triumph. Instead, she gets the ultimate curveball: the very ex-boyfriend who broke her heart is cast as the male lead. \n\n\"You wrote our story,\" he whispers, getting dangerously close. \"So why shouldn't we have a happy ending?\"\n\n[Original Novel](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=13533720)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=855178), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14759995)",
